rrentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> 持续关注</b>　A区4床防跌倒、协助活动；B区6床复评并记录；抢救区2床家属到达。</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:24px;\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d5e0e8;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;height:224px;\"><div style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:700;color:#245470;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.22 13H9.5l.5-1 2 4.5 2-7 1.5 3.5h5.27\"></path></svg> 抢救区 · 1床</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:12px;\">呼吸困难留观<br>血氧饱和度：93% → <b>复测96%</b><br>持续监测<br><span style=\"color:#80521f;\">胸部影像结果待回报</span></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d5e0e8;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;height:224px;\"><div style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:700;color:#245470;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg> 留观A区 · 3床</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:12px;\">腹痛留观<br>疼痛：入院7分